Scoped SoX native intermediate format layout

The header fields, probe, header validation, PCM packet semantics and sample-count
trailer in src/sox.ts follow libavformat/soxdec.c (sox_probe, sox_read_header),
soxenc.c (sox_write_header, sox_write_trailer), sox.h (SOX_FIXED_HDR, SOX_TAG)
and pcm.c (ff_pcm_read_packet, ff_pcm_read_seek).
